  "description": "Explore Peter Parker's fresh starts in the comics, including Brand New Day, for background on the film's namesake era. Coming Home, Brand New Day and Back to Basics show different ways of rebuilding Spider-Man's life and responsibilities. This is character context, not a prediction of the film's plot. Venom Super Special (1995) #1 is still missing provider details; the bonus-story selections open their whole original comics.",
